# Repository-local ignores for the dotfiles repo itself.
# Machine-wide patterns (.DS_Store, editor dirs, secrets) live in
# .gitignore_global, which setup.sh registers via core.excludesfile.

# Regenerated by `brew bundle` on every run — a snapshot of one machine,
# not a declaration. nvim/lazy-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it
# pins plugin versions and must stay tracked.
Brewfile.lock.json
